---
---
<div class="my-10 p-8 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0B1120] rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 dark:text-navy-400 uppercase mb-8 text-center">The Three Possible Futures</div>

  <div class="w-full max-w-4xl grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10">
    
    {/* 1. The Bridge */}
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/40 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-500 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg">
        1
      </div>
      <div class="text-sm font-black tracking-widest text-slate-800 dark:text-white uppercase mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800">
        The Bridge
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-3 flex-1">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Environment:</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">India uses the years 2026–2029 to structurally strengthen its external position (exports, FDI, strong reserves).</div>
        
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-4">Outcome:</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Most deposits are manageable through ordinary rollover, robust reserves, and healthy FX flows.</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 tracking-wider">
        The policy worked as intended.
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 2. The Refinancing Cycle */}
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/40 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col hover:border-amber-400 dark:hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold text-lg">
        2
      </div>
      <div class="text-sm font-black tracking-widest text-slate-800 dark:text-white uppercase mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800">
        The Refinancing Cycle
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-3 flex-1">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Environment:</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The underlying current-account constraints remain. India still needs extraordinary foreign funding when deposits mature.</div>
        
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-4">Outcome:</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">High rates are offered again. Investors roll their claims. Immediate outflow is avoided, but dependence remains.</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 tracking-wider">
        The problem was postponed.
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 3. The Exit Shock */}
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-900 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800/40 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col hover:border-rose-400 dark:hover:border-rose-500 transition-colors transform md:-translate-y-2">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-bold text-lg">
        3
      </div>
      <div class="text-sm font-black tracking-widest text-slate-800 dark:text-white uppercase mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800">
        The Exit Shock
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-3 flex-1">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Environment:</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Deposits mature during a hostile global dollar environment. Other external demands (oil, capital flight) rise simultaneously.</div>
        
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-4">Outcome:</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Rollover collapses. The banking system and RBI must supply a massive quantity of dollars at the worst possible time.</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-800 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 tracking-wider">
        Liquidity becomes an FX crisis.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>
